// Syncthing ignore rules for the iZACH "shared brain" folder sync.
//
// Deny-by-default: everything is ignored unless explicitly un-ignored below.
// This folder is the whole iZACH project root, which also contains real
// secrets (.env, credentials.json, pairing_secret.json, browser_passwords.json,
// api_keys.json) and huge/platform-specific junk (node_modules, .venv,
// izach_rag_db, .wwebjs_auth) — none of that should ever leave this machine,
// so only the specific memory/history/vault files below are synced.
*

// Smart memory, personal memory, contacts, WhatsApp history — the actual
// "shared brain" data: profile facts, instructions, automations, people.
!/smart_memory.json
!/memory.json
!/contacts.json
!/wa_processed_msgs.json

// Browser custom links (Cortex UI Browser widget's saved-link shortcuts) —
// no secrets, safe to share so both machines see the same bookmark set.
!/custom_links.json

// Browser history — decided to sync (Phase 5). No secrets in it, just
// visited-URL entries; both machines see the same browsing history.
// Login SESSIONS deliberately stay OUT — and structurally can't be synced
// through this mechanism even if we wanted to: Electron's session partition
// (cookies/localStorage for the in-app browser) lives in the OS's own
// userData directory, not inside this project folder at all, so it was
// never reachable by Syncthing here regardless of this file.
!/browser_history.json

// Obsidian vault — iZACH's own long-term notes (Identity/Instructions/
// Automations/People), the same folder either machine's Obsidian app opens.
!/iZACH-Brain
!/iZACH-Brain/**

// Runtime logs — useful to see what the OTHER machine was doing recently.
!/logs
!/logs/**

// Explicitly NOT synced (documented here so it's obvious, not just implied
// by the deny-by-default * above): .env, credentials.json,
// fitness_credentials.json, smart_home_credentials.json, api_keys.json,
// pairing_secret.json, browser_passwords.json,
// token.json, token_gmail.json, keys and ids, .wwebjs_auth/, .wwebjs_cache/
// (WhatsApp session — machine-specific, never share), izach_rag_db/ (ChromaDB
// binary index — a future addition, not v1), voice_profiles/, speaker_profiles/,
// owner_voice.* (biometric data), node_modules/, .venv/, .git/, screenshots/,
// shared/, izach-android/, izach-ui/node_modules/, izach-ui/dist/.
